        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "NAEP Data Explorer",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "NAEP Data Explorer provides representative assessment results across national, state, and participating urban-district samples. It supplies benchmark and trend context; it does not establish that an initiative caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/naepdata/",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "83d913e1a1fd4f34aeeeed97c183d852"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "NAEP catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** National Center for Education Statistics.\n- **Access:** Custom tables and charts; qualified users may access restricted-use microdata.\n- **Unit:** Representative assessment result and subgroup.\n- **Coverage:** Assessment-specific trend series across decades.\n- **Geography:** Nation, state, and participating urban district; not school level.\n- **Join keys:** Jurisdiction, assessment year, grade, subject, and subgroup.\n- **Measures:** Scale scores, achievement levels, and questionnaire context.\n- **Use boundary:** Preserve the assessment, population, and sampling context.\n\nNAEP supports national/state benchmarks and achievement-trend context. It must not be used alone to attribute an initiative effect.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
